    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B02",
      "act": "STATEMENT",
      "narration_text": "Ask a language model about your own PDF and it does one of two things: says it does not know, or invents an answer that sounds right. It never saw the document.",
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "manim",
        "motion": "fade",
        "manim": {
          "scene_class": "B02",
          "file": "scenes.py"
        }
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B02.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 9.26,
      "build": {
        "status": "MANIM",
        "src": "manim\\B02.mp4",
        "filled_by": "manim:B02",
        "at": "2026-08-31T12:48:47"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B03",
      "act": "LIST",
      "narration_text": "The fix is four moves. Chunk the P D F, embed each chunk into a vector, retrieve the nearest ones to your question, and ground the answer in them.",
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "manim",
        "motion": "fade",
        "manim": {
          "scene_class": "B03",
          "file": "scenes.py"
        }
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B03.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 8.36,
      "build": {
        "status": "MANIM",
        "src": "manim\\B03.mp4",
        "filled_by": "manim:B03",
        "at": "2026-08-31T12:48:47"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B04",
      "act": "STATEMENT",
      "narration_text": "Embedding turns text into numbers. Sentence-transformers runs on PyTorch and gives you one vector per chunk — three hundred eighty-four numbers each.",
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "manim",
        "motion": "fade",
        "manim": {
          "scene_class": "B04",
          "file": "scenes.py"
        }
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B04.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 10.3,
      "build": {
        "status": "MANIM",
        "src": "manim\\B04.mp4",
        "filled_by": "manim:B04",
        "at": "2026-08-31T12:48:47"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B05",
      "act": "STATEMENT",
      "narration_text": "Because the vectors are unit length, the whole search is one line: q at emb transpose ranks every chunk by cosine similarity. Take the top four.",
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "manim",
        "motion": "fade",
        "manim": {
          "scene_class": "B05",
          "file": "scenes.py"
        }
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B05.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 8.92,
      "build": {
        "status": "MANIM",
        "src": "manim\\B05.mp4",
        "filled_by": "manim:B05",
        "at": "2026-08-31T12:48:47"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B06",
      "act": "STATEMENT",
      "narration_text": "The model then reads only those four passages — grounded in your document, with a citation you can check yourself.",
